{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WuKongIM/packages/pulls/67","id":4946529843,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUJ8YLs8AAAABJtYOMw","html_url":"https://github.com/WuKongIM/packages/pull/67","diff_url":"https://github.com/WuKongIM/packages/pull/67.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/WuKongIM/packages/pull/67.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WuKongIM/packages/issues/67","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WuKongIM/packages/pulls/67/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WuKongIM/packages/pulls/67/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WuKongIM/packages/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WuKongIM/packages/issues/67/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WuKongIM/packages/statuses/0ce7184bbf69472f607159f74a096e9160852843","number":67,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"feat: prepare complete read-only stable source preflight","user":{"login":"tangtaoit","id":3895878,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4OTU4Nzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3895878?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit","html_url":"https://github.com/tangtaoit","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tangtaoit/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nStable source Releases could not complete the existing preview-only preflight. Add an explicit expected source channel through strict Release resolution, fixed-workflow provenance and native DEB/RPM metadata verification. Preview remains the default; stable requires a strict non-prerelease version and GitHub `prerelease: false`.\n\nRetain immutable numeric Release identity, main ancestry, the seven-asset checksum closure and signer-workflow checks. The metadata CLI verifies all source bytes before and after native queries, checks package name/architecture/version plus RPM release and epoch, rejects all four legacy/header signature fields, and binds its receipt to exact source and package identities. It never installs or executes source payloads and passes no credentials to native inspectors.\n\nExtend the existing credential-free TEST ONLY drill with tiny real stable/preview packages, wrong-identity cases, and an actual RSAHEADER-signed RPM rejection using a scratch-only test key in the existing pinned, network-disabled toolchain. Synthetic fixture provenance is not release provenance.\n\nProduction stable remains disabled. This change does not alter manifests, public keys, production signing, audit/publisher/storage/bootstrap code, toolchain pins or permissions.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Test-first failures retained for source classification, missing metadata CLI, RPM Epoch and workflow propagation.\n- 52 source-related tests pass; `tests/contract.sh`, actionlint for both changed workflows, Python syntax and `git diff --check` pass.\n- Independent review re-ran the 14 metadata and two workflow tests; no remaining blocking finding.\n- Prior head `dafbc9d` passed the snapshot and existing TEST ONLY repository CI. New head `0ce7184bbf69472f607159f74a096e9160852843` requires fresh CI, including all seven real native metadata scenarios; those cannot run on the local macOS host without native tools/Docker.\n- Each signature field has subprocess-boundary rejection coverage. Native coverage specifically requires RSAHEADER and reports the actual observed tags, without claiming every historical signing format was generated.\n\nNo current stable source Release or production stable publication has been exercised. Signed public APT/RPM exact-version client acceptance remains a separate release requirement.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-21T04:45:36Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T05:31:08Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"4e73d6fbeb255d1206409537d00f1d76eb151623","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"WuKongIM:codex/stable-source-classification","ref":"codex/stable-source-classification","repo":{"id":1352603694,"node_id":"R_kgDOUJ8YLg","name":"packages","full_name":"WuKongIM/packages","owner":{"login":"WuKongIM","id":132860831,"node_id":"O_kgDOB-tLnw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/132860831?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM","html_url":"https://github.com/WuKongIM","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WuKongIM/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"Signed APT and RPM repositories for WuKongIM","homepage":null,"language":"Python","visibility":"public","is_template":false,"topics":[],"forks_count":0,"forks":0,"stargazers_count":0,"watchers_count":0,"watchers":0,"open_